It is lunchtime.
I am hungry and go outside.
I walk to the bakery on the corner.
The bakery is very busy.
Many people buy their lunch here.
I wait briefly.
Then it is my turn.
"Hello, what can I get you?" asks the shop assistant.
"I will take a cheese Brötchen and a black tea, please," I answer.
The shop assistant gives me the Brötchen and the tea.
"That makes four Euro fifty, please," he says.
I pay with a ten Euro note.
He gives me my change and the receipt.
"Thank you very much and have a nice day," he says.
"Thank you, you too," I say.
I go back outside.
The weather is really beautiful.
I sit down on a bench in the sun.
I drink my tea and eat my Brötchen.
